"                               [indstilling] er en af: none supereagle 2xsai\n"
"                               super2xsai hq2x hq3x hq4x 2xbrz 3xbrz 4xbrz epx ntsc\n"
"\n"
"-mutesound                     Deaktiverer lydoutput.\n"

